Rev C of the planting plan is in Projects > Wattle Grove Park.

The main change is along the creek edge. I swapped the lomandra for a mix of carex and dianella, which should cope better with the wet patch Lucas found on the last site visit. I also pulled the two bottlebrushes back from the path so they don't crowd the new bench.

Let me know if you want anything else changed before the client review.

Tom

